@startuml UC09 - Customer Segmentation - Sequence Diagram
title UC09 - Customer Segmentation - Sequence Diagram

actor "Sales User" as Sales
participant "Next.js" as FE
participant "NestJS API" as API
database "PostgreSQL" as DB
participant "RabbitMQ" as MQ
participant "n8n" as N8N
participant "AI / Rule Engine" as AI

Sales -> FE : 1. Start Segmentation
FE -> API : 2. POST segmentation request
API -> DB : 3. Get Customers
DB --> API : 4. Return Customer data
API -> DB : 5. Get Segment Criteria
DB --> API : 6. Return Criteria
API -> MQ : 7. Publish segmentation event
MQ -> N8N : 8. Deliver event
N8N -> AI : 9. Evaluate Customer
AI --> N8N : 10. Return Segment result
N8N -> API : 11. Submit assignment result
API -> DB : 12. Save CustomerSegment

@enduml
